This subtree is deliberately licensed differently from the rest of the
AuralPrimer repository, which is GPL-3.0-or-later. The Unity runtime is
proprietary and cannot be sublicensed under the GPL, so a GPL-licensed Unity
binary would be a combined work that could not be conveyed under the GPL in
full. Apache-2.0 removes that conflict outright rather than papering over it
with a GPLv3 section 7 linking exception.

Third-party components (Unity engine, packages installed via the Package
Manager, and any imported assets) retain their own licenses.
